cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "AI search citations dataset"
abstract: >-
  Open dataset of the websites that ChatGPT, Google AI Overviews, Google AI
  Mode, Gemini, Microsoft Copilot and Claude list and cite as sources, and the
  businesses and products they name, when buyers ask them questions; updated
  with each study. Release 2026.10 covers 138 answers about AI search
  collected on 2026-10-14. Release 2026.11 adds four studies of who AI names
  for local businesses in US cities and for B2B software, collected from the
  United States on 2026-11-19 to 2026-11-21.
authors:
  - name: "Cited (cited.io)"
    website: "https://cited.io"
version: "2026.11"
date-released: "2026-11-23"
license: CC-BY-4.0
url: "https://github.com/Cited-io/ai-search-citations-dataset"
keywords:
  - ai search
  - generative engine optimization
  - answer engine optimization
  - ai visibility
  - citations
  - chatgpt
  - google ai overviews
  - gemini
  - copilot
  - claude
  - local search
  - google maps
  - google reviews
